# Day 30 – RANK() and DENSE_RANK()

## What I Learned
Today I learned about:

- What RANK() is
- What DENSE_RANK() is
- The difference between RANK and DENSE_RANK
- How OVER() works
- How PARTITION BY works in ranking
- When to use each ranking function

RANK and DENSE_RANK are window functions used to assign rankings to rows.

---

## Basic Structure

```sql
RANK()
OVER (
    PARTITION BY column_name
    ORDER BY column_name
)

DENSE_RANK()
OVER (
    PARTITION BY column_name
    ORDER BY column_name
)
